<title>USA: Capital Pacific retains firm for strategy.</title>
<headline>Capital Pacific retains firm for strategy.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, Calif. 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Capital Pacific Holdings Inc said on Monday it has retained the investment banking firm of Morgan Stanley &amp; Co to evaluate ways of potentially enhancing shareholder value.</p>
<p>Capital Pacific said among the options to be explored are potential strategic alliances, mergers, acquisitions, and infusions of capital from institutional and other private investment sources, which may involve a transfer of a portion or all of the equity of the company.</p>
</text>
